Columns: win = controls whose true setting beat every sampled wrong setting.
         medMargin / medZ = median margin and median z-score of the truth.
         plugs = median true plugs recovered of 10. corr = median letters right.

This is a measurement, not a break. It bounds what the crib-free path can reach
on this traffic class before any of it is pointed at P1030680.
